{
  "_about": "Role x pillar matrix: which of the 28 capability pillars (content/structure/pillars.json) a role MUST pass, is advised to learn, or may skip. `everyone` applies to every role; a role adds to it (the stronger stance wins). required: tracks in that pillar become mandatory-for-role learning with the track's own level and deadline, but only for tracks the person can see and that have enough questions. recommended: not enforced; used to pick a new joiner's starter plan and ordered first in suggestions. Anything unlisted is optional. Tracks in a library brand (skill libraries such as Titan Academy and Foundations, listed in libraryBrands) are never made required by this file, only recommended, so tagging forty language courses with the code pillar does not make a developer pass all of them. A track an admin has edited on Paths (policy source 'admin') ignores this file. Edit here, then run `npm run check:blueprint`.",
